  "description": "Barrel Barrel is a play tower in the shape of a wooden barrel, with a Baby Blue wavy slide and a cage on top. Children climb in through an arch opening, up a rope net inside the barrel and out onto the top, then slide down. Blue climbing holds on the outside give a second way up. Parents can join in at the base, and the design invites play between children and adults. It suits ages 5 to 12. The tower is small, with a product area of 13'7\" x 5'4\" and a safe play area of 19'2\" x 10'4\". It builds arm strength, coordination and interactive play. Up to 15 children can use it at once, and the main structure carries a 3-year warranty. Tell us your corner size for a fit check.",
